# Raw probe output is runtime research state, not source: it is large (310 MB
# for one 45-minute websocket run), it is regenerated by re-running the probe,
# and committing it to the code branch is the same mistake as committing live
# prediction rows. The SCRIPTS and the FINDINGS are versioned; the tape is not.
observations.jsonl
